{
  "uid": "otel-telemetry-flow",
  "title": "OpenTelemetry | Telemetry Flow & Pipeline Health",
  "tags": [
    "opentelemetry",
    "collector",
    "pipeline",
    "gitops"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Configured Telemetry Topology (not automatic discovery)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Fedora worker \u2192 OTel Agent \u2192 OTel Gateway\n\n**OTel Agent** (hostmetrics, 30s) **\u2014 OTLP/gRPC :4317 \u2192 OTel Gateway** (OTLP receiver, memory limiter, transform, batch)\n\n\u21b3 **Prometheus**: scrapes Gateway exported metrics on **:8889**  |  \u21b3 **Mimir**: Gateway **Prometheus remote write** to **:9009/api/v1/push**\n\n**Control-plane monitoring:** Prometheus scrapes **Agent :8888** and **Gateway :8888** independently. These self-metrics measure Collector processing, not confirmed end-to-end backend ingestion."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Agent and Gateway scrape availability",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{namespace=\"observability\",endpoint=\"self-metrics\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} / {{endpoint}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "1=Prometheus successfully scraped target; 0=failed",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Gateway host-metric exporter scrape availability",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{namespace=\"observability\",job=\"otel-gateway\",endpoint=\"prometheus\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} / {{endpoint}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Prometheus scrape of Gateway :8889; verify endpoint label if different",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Agent \u2192 Gateway: exported metric points/s",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (job, exporter) (rate(otelcol_exporter_sent_metric_points{job=\"otel-hostmetrics-agent\",endpoint=\"self-metrics\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} \u2192 {{exporter}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
